{"shortDescription":"RNS Number : 1218U  FRP Advisory Group PLC  09 September 2026   \t\t\t\t\t9 September 2026FRP Advisory Group plc(\"FRP\", the \"Group\" or the \"Company\")Director/PDMR ShareholdingFRP Advisory Group plc, a leading national specialist business advisory firm, announces that on 26 August 2026, Gavin Jones, Chie…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":["RNS Number : 1218U  FRP Advisory Group PLC  09 September 2026   \t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["9 September 2026"]},{"type":"p","children":["FRP Advisory Group plc"]},{"type":"p","children":["(\"FRP\", the \"Group\" or the \"Company\")"]},{"type":"p","children":["Director/PDMR Shareholding"]},{"type":"p","children":["FRP Advisory Group plc, a leading national specialist business advisory firm, announces that on 26 August 2026, Gavin Jones, Chief Financial Officer of the Company, instructed the exercise of nil cost options over 141,807 ordinary shares of 0.1p each in the Company (“Ordinary Shares”). These options were satisfied using Ordinary Shares held in the Company’s Employee Benefit Trust. Furthermore, on 26 August 2026 Mr Jones instructed the sale of a sufficient number of Ordinary Shares to satisfy personal income tax and national insurance liabilities arising from the option exercise. This resulted in the sale of 66,884 Ordinary Shares."]},{"type":"p","children":["Following completion of these transactions, Mr Jones beneficially holds 328,604 Ordinary Shares representing 0.13 per cent. of the Company’s issued share capital."]},{"type":"p","children":["The notification below, made in accordance with the requirements of the UK Market Abuse Regulation, provides further detail."]},{"type":"p","children":["Enquiries:"]},{"type":"p","children":["FRP Advisory Group plc"]},{"type":"p","children":["Geoff Rowley, CEO"]},{"type":"p","children":["Jeremy French, COO"]},{"type":"p","children":["Gavin Jones, CFO"]},{"type":"p","children":["Enquiries via Citypress"]},{"type":"p","children":["Cavendish Capital Markets Limited (Nominated Adviser and Joint Broker)"]},{"type":"p","children":["Stephen Keys / George Lawson / Elysia Bough (Corporate Finance)"]},{"type":"p","children":["Tel: +44 (0) 207 220 0500"]},{"type":"p","children":["Berenberg (Joint Broker)"]},{"type":"p","children":["Toby Flaux / James Thompson / Brooke Harris-Lowing"]},{"type":"p","children":["+44 (0)20 3207 7800"]},{"type":"p","children":["Citypress (Financial Public Relations)"]},{"type":"p","children":["Martin Currie / Jamie Williamson"]},{"type":"p","children":["Tel: +44 (0)7976291532 / +44 (0)7908 536 423"]},{"type":"p","children":["FRPreporting@citypress.co.uk"]},{"type":"p","children":["Notes to Editors:"]},{"type":"p","children":["FRP is a leading national specialist business advisory firm established in 2010. It offers a range of advisory services to companies, lenders, investors and other stakeholders, as well as individuals. These services include:"]},{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"*","children":["Restructuring advisory: corporate financial advisory, formal insolvency appointments, informal restructuring advisory, personal insolvency and general advice to all stakeholders.\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"*","children":["Corporate finance: mergers \u0026 acquisitions (M\u0026A), strategic advisory and valuations, financial due diligence, capital raising, special situations M\u0026A and partial exits.\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"*","children":["Debt advisory: raising and refinancing debt, debt amendments and extensions, restructuring debt, asset based lending and corporate and leveraged debt advisory.\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"*","children":["Forensic services: forensic investigations, compliance and risk advisory, dispute services and forensic technology.\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"*","children":["Financial advisory: transaction services including pre-IPO financial services, financial due diligence, lender services, financial modelling, valuations, pensions and company-side advisory services and corporate governance advisory.\t\t\t\t"]}]},{"type":"p","children":["NOTIFICATION AND PUBLIC DISCLOSURE OF TRANSACTIONS BY PERSONS DISCHARGING MANAGERIAL RESPONSIBILITIES AND PERSONS CLOSELY ASSOCIATED WITH THEM"]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["1"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":3},"children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["Details of the person discharging managerial responsibilities/person closely associated"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["a."]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["Name of PDMR"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":2},"children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["Gavin Jones"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["2"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":3},"children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["Reason for notification"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["a."]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["Position/Status"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":2},"children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["Chief Financial Officer"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-dat